  "published": "2026-11-01T20:25:19.56Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Hardware information is now read directly from the Windows APIs (SMBIOS, storage and NDIS IOCTLs, PnP, EDID, registry, spooler, WlanAPI) instead of WMI and wrapper libraries: a scan takes about 10 ms instead of seconds, and the library has no third-party dependencies anymore. New identifiers: per-disk NVMe, ATA, SCSI VPD and DUID fields, firmware, WWN and partition table GUID; PnP instance paths; monitor EDID hash and manufacture date; chassis; Bluetooth radios; batteries; machine GUID, hardware profile GUID, install time and machine SID. Public API unchanged (additive); targets .NET 10 and .NET Framework 4.8.",
